<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA-YIELDS DOWN ON 28-DAY T-BILLS.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA-YIELDS DOWN ON 28-DAY T-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yields declined on 28-day</p>
<p>Lithuanian T-bills at Monday's auction and the 30 million litas</p>
<p>issue was oversubscribed, the central bank said.</p>
<p>MATURITY  AV.YIELD  LAST   MIN/MAX  ISSUE  BID   SOLD</p>
<p>28-days    7.25     7.87  7.00/8.07  30   53.472  30</p>
<p>The settlement date is July 3 and the bills mature on July</p>
<p>31.</p>
<p>The next auction is on Monday, July 7, when 50 million litas</p>
<p>of 91-day paper will be offered.</p>
<p>-- Burton Frierson, Vilnius newsroom +371 721 52 40</p>
</text>
